%% Phase 4.5 — Integration Scenario Diagrams

flowchart TD
    A["🏗️ Build Artifact\n(docker, wheel)"]
    B["✓ Run Tests\n(suite + integration)"]
    C["🔒 Security Scan\n(SAST, secrets)"]
    D{"All Pass?"}
    E["📤 Upload Artifact\n(Docker registry, PyPI)"]
    F["🚀 Deploy to Staging\n(test environment)"]
    G["🧪 Smoke Tests\n(basic functionality)"]
    H["✅ Deploy to Prod\n(rollout strategy)"]
    I["📊 Monitor\n(metrics, logs)"]
    J["🎉 Deployment Complete"]
    K["❌ Rollback\n(restore previous)"]
    
    A --> B --> C --> D
    D -->|"no"| K
    D -->|"yes"| E --> F --> G
    G -->|"fail"| K
    G -->|"pass"| H --> I --> J
    
    style A fill:#4a4e69,color:#fff
    style J fill:#1b4332,color:#fff
    style K fill:#e63946,color:#fff
